{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34472","headline":"中元夜寄道侣二首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"中元夜寄道侣二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"橘斋风露已清余，东郭先生病未除。\n孤枕易爲蛩破梦，短檐难得燕传书。\n广云披日君应近，倒影裁花我尚疎。\n唯羡羽人襟似水，平持旄节步空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}